# Release signing — NEVER commit these.
# key.properties holds the keystore password in plain text, and the .jks is the
# signing identity itself. Anyone with both can publish an update that Play and
# every installed device will accept as genuine, and the key cannot be rotated
# for an existing app listing.
android/key.properties
key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
